### 3. NAMING CONVENTIONS (MANDATORY)
```python
# Element Type Prefixes - STRICT COMPLIANCE
btn_element_name = "//button"           # Buttons
inp_element_name = "//input"            # Input fields
sel_element_name = "//select"           # Select dropdowns
